Package: com.nktouch.nkcrane
Name: NKCrane
Version: 0.9.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Clean-room multi-container engine for NKTouch. v0.9.0 adds low-level filesystem path virtualization so app file access under the real sandbox is redirected into the active NKCrane container, improving separation for modern frameworks that bypass NSHomeDirectory-style APIs.
Maintainer: NKTouch
Author: NKTouch
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
